    fetchTasks();
    fetchShoppingList();
}
```

Exactly right -- `[isLoggedIn]` is only the trigger; it doesn't gate the body. The effect runs on mount regardless, so with no `if isLoggedIn` check inside, `fetchTasks()` fires for anonymous users. Wrap the body in the guard so the fetches only happen when authenticated:

```jac
cl {
